    "seed": "docs/reference/role-catalogue-seed.json - generated from config/rbac.config.js",
    "tenant": "docs/reference/sharepoint-list-index.json - GUID, site and the adopted flag",
    "provisioned": "docs/reference/sharepoint-provisioning-spec.json - the extracted provisioning workbook that DEFINES the governance lists, column by column, with the required flag and the choice set. Stronger than 'deployed' for a list no exported flow writes to yet: the estate specified these columns before anything wrote them, and DGO_AuditLog rejects a row that omits the four it marks required."
